sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Cliente
    participant A as API REST
    participant P as ProvisioningService
    participant K as Kubernetes API
    participant PG as PostgreSQL

    C->>A: POST /instances {engine: postgres, plan: dedicated-s}
    A->>P: createInstance(config)
    P->>P: valida motor, plan y cuota
    P->>K: crea Namespace + ResourceQuota + LimitRange
    P->>K: crea NetworkPolicy
    P->>P: genera contraseña (crypto.randomBytes)
    P->>K: crea Secret
    P->>K: crea StatefulSet + PVC + Service
    K->>PG: programa el Pod
    PG-->>K: readiness (pg_isready)
    P->>K: espera rollout
    P-->>A: ConnectionInfo
    A-->>C: 201 {host, port, database, user, sslmode}
    Note over C,PG: El PVC conserva los datos al reiniciar el Pod
